1
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,600
Aren't you embarrassed?

2
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,720
Captain Jing, Captain Qi.

3
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,080
I know you had your reservations,

4
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,720
so you didn't use full force.

5
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,960
If we were really criminals,

6
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,640
I'm afraid even with superhuman abilities,

7
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,200
we still couldn't have escaped.

8
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,200
So,

9
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,400
sorry about this.

10
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,000
We still have to trouble you two

11
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,960
to give us a ride.

12
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,440
After you.

13
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:35,920
Not bad.

14
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,560
Three minutes early.

15
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,240
Salute!

16
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,760
Comrade Police Officer,

17
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,960
Comrade Commander,

18
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,360
mission successfully accomplished.

19
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,000
Good work.

20
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:54,800
Guo Zijian,

21
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,040
you won.

22
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,400
I knew I was right about you.

23
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,000
Pack it up.

24
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,120
Yes, sir.

25
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,160
Comrade Deputy Brigade Commander,

26
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,760
eight members of the Wind Rider Battalion

27
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:25,640
reporting as ordered.

28
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,560
Awaiting your instructions.

29
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,560
So far,

30
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,600
you're right on time.

31
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,000
Return to your unit.

32
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:33,680
Yes, sir.

33
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,240
Hold on.

34
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,560
Watch your personal conduct.

35
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:42,120
Yes, sir.

36
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,240
Mount up.

37
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,920
What are you laughing at?

38
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,040
Mount up.

39
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:51,840
Yes, sir.

40
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,600
I really didn't expect

41
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,000
that in the end,

42
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,920
it would be our Captain Jing's

43
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,560
warm hug that

44
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,480
declared the operation over.

45
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,560
The military and police are one family.

46
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:11,240
Urban warfare is the top priority

47
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,400
of modern warfare.

48
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:15,600
We should hold such drills

49
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,920
more often in the future.

50
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,560
Battalion Commander Guo,

51
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,040
you're finally back.

52
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,640
Why are you here?

53
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,040
Where's that pretty police officer?

54
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,120
Instead of doing your job,

55
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,800
what are you running around for?

56
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,360
During this maritime training,

57
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,440
we need to coordinate with defense manufacturers

58
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,240
to complete testing on new equipment.

59
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,760
Military Dream Group's

60
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,960
Green Military Products Platform

61
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:49,760
has now become

62
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:51,440
the country's largest and most advanced

63
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:53,040
communication platform for private defense enterprises.

64
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:54,680
As you know,

65
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:55,560
Ms. Chen is

66
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,840
the CEO of this platform.

67
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,640
So she's not just running around.

68
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,680
She's here for work.

69
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,280
Staff Officer Liang is absolutely right.

70
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,360
Since when did you two get so close?

71
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,200
What, are you jealous?

72
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,000
Platoon Leader,

73
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,040
our battalion commander,

74
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,960
aside from being too harsh with assignments,

75
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,520
treats our Special Operations Platoon really well.

76
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,440
Letting us patrol the sea this time...

77
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,080
It's awesome.

78
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,440
Honey Badger, this is Mountain Eagle.

79
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,400
Honey Badger copies.

80
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,360
Awaiting orders.

81
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,280
There's a change of mission.

82
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,480
Starting now,

83
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,760
I order all armed special ops members of your platoon

84
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:22,760
to fast-rope onto uninhabited island No. 34

85
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,200
and immediately commence

86
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,480
extreme survival training.

87
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,240
Duration is one week. Repeat if you copy.

88
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,480
Honey Badger repeating.

89
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,040
Extreme training

90
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,280
for one week.

91
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,040
Over.

92
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,000
Correct.

93
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,920
Sea training for the remaining equipment and personnel

94
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,120
will be made up at a suitable time.

95
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,480
Honey Badger understands.

96
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,040
Rally on me.

97
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,280
After landing on the island,

98
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,800
quickly recon the area

99
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,120
and formulate a survival plan.

100
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,520
Yes, sir!

101
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:06,840
Move out!

102
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,080
What did I say?

103
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,280
You have to look at both sides of things.

104
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,840
Even though it's pouring right now,

105
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:38,800
it solved

106
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,600
our freshwater problem for the next few days.

107
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,680
You're telling me.

108
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,240
Desalinating seawater the other day,

109
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,200
the smoke from the fire still makes my eyes hurt.

110
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,480
Squad Leader,

111
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,040
let's start a fire to warm up.

112
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,360
Everyone's clothes are soaked through.

113
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,200
No fires.

114
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,440
If this were a combat situation,

115
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,480
a fire would expose us.

116
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,440
Alright.

117
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,160
Lean against each other

118
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:56,840
and get some rest.

119
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,360
Come on.

120
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,080
Actually,

121
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:03,480
I think

122
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,240
our biggest problem isn't sleeping.

123
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,080
Zhao Xiaoyun,

124
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,520
shut your mouth

125
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,520
and get some rest.

126
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,360
Time to sleep.

127
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:24,880
Give it a try.

128
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,280
All set.

129
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,480
Of course.

130
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,720
Is there anything Staff Officer Liang can't handle?

131
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,040
Then this should do.

132
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,040
Ms. Chen.

133
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:05,760
Look.

134
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,200
That drone is back.

135
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,520
This drone

136
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,240
has been hovering around here for days.

137
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,200
It's equipped with

138
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,720
specialized reconnaissance gear.

139
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,240
This is a key coastal defense zone.

140
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,840
Could someone be trying to steal secrets?

141
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,280
Xiao Lin.

142
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,160
After it.

143
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:26,760
Understood.

144
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,280
Xiao Lin.

145
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,240
Did you catch up?

146
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:00,920
I did.

147
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,640
But I'm about to lose the signal.

148
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:03,800
Returning now.

149
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,160
We're dealing with a pro.

150
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,600
Let's go. We're going after it.

151
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:21,240
Yes.

152
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,280
The recent combined training has been effective.

153
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,520
Staff Officer Liang.

154
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,480
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

155
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,720
When Ms. Chen and I were testing drones,

156
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,280
we spotted a suspicious drone

157
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,600
appearing near our location.

158
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,720
We're tracking it now.

159
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,520
What model is it?

160
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,040
Did you observe its flight path?

161
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:51,520
It doesn't have a model.

162
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,680
But it has been modified.

163
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,800
Equipped with a camera and thermal imaging.

164
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,160
Its flight path is quite erratic.

165
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,640
I just compiled a report.

166
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:59,120
Together with photos of the drone,

167
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,040
I'm sending it to you now.

168
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,840
Are there any important military targets nearby?

169
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,280
This area was approved by the local armed forces.

170
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,440
There are no military targets.

171
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:09,040
But since it's not far from our training site,

172
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:09,920
I'm worried

173
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,520
that they're scouting us.

174
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,320
Understood. I'll report to Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

175
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,800
Return to base as soon as possible.

176
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:19,520
Yes, sir.

177
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,480
Stay safe.

178
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:20,960
Understood.

179
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,600
Return to base immediately.

180
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,360
We've been tracking it for so long.

181
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:27,280
Going back now would waste all our effort.

182
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,480
How about this? We'll be careful

183
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,400
and avoid getting spotted.

184
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,400
Ms. Chen, but...

185
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,560
No buts.

186
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,240
There's no need to be so tense.

187
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:36,200
It could just be some military enthusiast

188
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,160
who modified it themselves.

189
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:43,240
Ms. Chen, turn left at the path ahead.

190
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,920
I'm already on my way.

191
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,920
I'll be there in half an hour.

192
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,480
Don't go looking for Guo Zijian yet.

193
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,560
Come straight to me.

194
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:55,640
We'll give him a surprise.

195
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:56,840
I'll send you the address later.

196
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,840
This surprise better not take too long.

197
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:01,400
I haven't seen the Battalion Commander in ages.

198
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:02,720
By the way,

199
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:03,880
where are you?

200
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,320
I'm tracking a drone.

201
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:07,600
I'll send you the location when I arrive.

202
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:09,320
Okay.

203
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,680
That's the situation.

204
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:15,400
Currently, Liang Hong and Chen Xiaoshan

205
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,120
are tracking the drone.

206
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:17,840
For safety reasons,

207
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,320
I've ordered them to return to base.

208
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,880
Enemy espionage on the southeast coast

209
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,040
has always been rampant.

210
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,960
Any suspicious activity

211
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,720
should not be taken lightly.

212
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:28,520
Here's what we'll do.

213
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,160
Give Jing Xiaochun a call

214
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,440
and find out the specifics.

215
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,240
Yes, sir.

216
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,480
Ms. Chen.

217
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,840
The drone has landed.

218
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,160
Send Wu Dongsheng the location.

219
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,040
Understood.

220
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,240
What the hell is this place?

221
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,520
Let's go take a look.

222
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:59,240
Alright.

223
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:00,680
Ms. Chen!

224
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,200
Hurry up.

225
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,040
He has a gun!

226
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,480
We need to leave now.

227
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:27,800
Wait a minute.

228
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:34,720
Freeze!

229
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,640
The situation you reported

230
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:45,480
is highly likely connected to a major case today.

231
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,960
A drug dealer escaped during transport.

232
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:48,960
Currently,

233
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,160
the police are in pursuit.

234
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,800
Since the drug dealer is armed,

235
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:53,920
we have requested backup from the local garrison.

236
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:56,400
Dongfang, contact Liang Hong immediately.

237
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,080
Yes, sir.

238
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,360
Sorry,

239
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,160
the number you dialed cannot be reached at the moment.

240
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:04,760
I can't get through.

241
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:05,760
Call Chen Xiaoshan.

242
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:06,520
Yes, sir.

243
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:12,880
Sorry,

244
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,040
the number you dialed cannot be reached at the moment.

245
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:15,920
I can't reach her either.

246
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,560
They are very likely in danger.

247
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:20,440
Here's the plan.

248
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,200
Notify the Special Operations Platoon immediately.

249
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,880
They haven't returned yet, right?

250
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:25,800
Right.

251
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,680
How did I forget about that?

252
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,720
I request to lead a rescue team.

253
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:31,640
No.

254
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,200
Without orders from superiors,

255
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,200
we cannot act on our own.

256
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,280
I will report this immediately.

257
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,720
We'll wait for instructions from above.

258
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,280
We are the closest unit to the incident area.

259
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,080
Prepare for combat.

260
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,200
Xiao Wu!

261
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:42,880
Sir!

262
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,560
Do you understand the situation?

263
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,200
Understood.

264
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,600
Report to military command immediately.

265
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,080
Yes, sir.

266
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:48,960
We will conduct a full-scale manhunt.

267
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,280
Deputy Brigade Commander,

268
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,680
if we report up the chain of command,

269
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,640
I'm afraid it will be too late.

270
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:53,680
Let's move out while we wait for orders.

271
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,200
That works.

272
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:58,000
But you must remember,

273
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,600
we can only provide secondary support.

274
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,240
Yes, sir.

275
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:01,960
Zeng Muhan!

276
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,080
Sir!

277
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:04,360
Report your position.

278
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,000
I have reached the reconnaissance vehicle.

279
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:08,480
Deploy the high-altitude reconnaissance drone immediately.

280
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,840
Search the last known location of Liang Hong and Chen Xiaoshan

281
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,960
within a thirty-kilometer radius.

282
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:13,640
Yes, sir.

283
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:36,680
Hello. The number you have dialed is powered off.

284
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,040
Take him down.

285
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:09,080
We've linked up with the police.

286
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:10,720
At the scene,

287
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,720
we found Liang Hong and Chen Xiaoshan's phones.

288
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:14,920
The phones have been damaged.

289
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,840
Now we can basically confirm

290
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,520
that this is the criminals' hideout.

291
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,280
Unfortunately, by the time we arrived,

292
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,680
the criminals had already relocated.

293
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:26,400
Can you determine their escape route?

294
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,440
We can't be sure yet.

295
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,320
Expand the search area immediately.

296
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,240
Yes, sir.

297
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,600
Are the three guys you hired reliable?

298
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,160
Don't worry, Brother Qiang.

299
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:45,120
We paid top dollar to get them here.

300
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:46,400
They have quite the reputation.

301
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,560
They're more than enough to deal with those cops.

302
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:51,840
Brother Qiang,

303
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,920
why don't we just toss them in the sea to feed the fish?

304
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:56,360
Keeping them is just a burden.

305
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:57,680
No.

306
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,280
The open sea is completely exposed.

307
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,480
In case we run into trouble,

308
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,400
they are our trump card.

309
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,720
You're always thinking ahead, boss.

310
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:10,800
Captain Jing,

311
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:12,960
if they want to escape police pursuit,

312
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,040
their best option is to head to the open sea.

313
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,680
And the open sea isn't far from here.

314
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:20,160
Have the helicopter patrol team search the sea surface.

315
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,200
Expand the perimeter further.

316
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,200
Everyone, replenish your strength.

317
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,400
Today

318
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:26,560
is our last day on the island.

319
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,520
Get some good rest and recuperate.

320
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,160
Prepare to pack up and go home.

321
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:32,960
Honey Badger, Honey Badger.

322
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,800
Do you copy?

323
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,080
This is Honey Badger.

324
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,000
Go ahead, Mountain Eagle.

325
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,720
Enter combat readiness immediately.

326
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,520
Stand by at your current position.

327
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,480
Honey Badger copies.

328
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,280
Platoon Leader,

329
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:42,240
something happened.

330
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,960
Attention, everyone!

331
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,360
From this moment on,

332
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:53,800
we are in a state of combat readiness.

333
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,280
Remember,

334
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,920
this is not a drill.

335
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,280
This is real combat.

336
00:17:58,600 --> 00:17:59,400
Yes, sir!

337
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:00,680
Combat readiness?

338
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,640
Do Yang Maolin and his men have live ammo?

339
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:05,440
On a deserted island,

340
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,040
unexpected things can happen at any time.

341
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,840
You kept emphasizing safety to me,

342
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,240
so I had them bring five rounds.

343
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,320
Two for the handguns,

344
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,240
and three for the rifles.

345
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,120
Just in case.

346
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:16,840
Why didn't you report it?

347
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:17,560
Sir,

348
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:18,920
it has already been reported.

349
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,200
All the paperwork is complete.

350
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:23,320
Are you sure?

351
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:23,880
I'm sure.

352
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,480
How can you be certain

353
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,520
the criminals will land on the deserted island?

354
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:34,800
Their destination is the open sea.

355
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,240
East of the deserted island is the open sea.

356
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:39,000
Fleeing from there is the shortest route.

357
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:40,240
Furthermore, the deserted island

358
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,000
is the only resting point on that route.

359
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,480
If we expand our search area,

360
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,080
it's highly likely they will go to the deserted island

361
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:46,920
to hide temporarily.

362
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:48,760
Execute the combat command well.

363
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:50,680
The details

364
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,840
must be considered thoroughly.

365
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,840
Especially the backup for the deserted island.

366
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,200
Yang Maolin and his men

367
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,120
only have five rounds of ammo, after all.

368
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,600
The enemy's firepower

369
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:00,920
cannot be underestimated.

370
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,320
As for the combat request,

371
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,040
I'll have someone handle it.

372
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,200
Understood.

373
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:09,400
Thank you, Chief.

374
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,560
No need to thank me.

375
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,400
They are my soldiers too.

376
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,480
Their safety

377
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,080
worries me even more than it worries you.

378
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:32,240
Helicopter crew reporting.

379
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,440
No targets spotted at sea.

380
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,040
Copy that. Continue searching.

381
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,280
If they take the water route,

382
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,720
they're likely to use the deserted island as a stepping stone,

383
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:43,680
and then, catching us off guard,

384
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:44,720
escape straight to international waters.

385
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,400
Yang Maolin is on the deserted island.

386
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,280
I'm not worried about that.

387
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,400
What I am worried about

388
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:50,600
is the hostage's safety.

389
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,240
Based on the current deployment,

390
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,720
the land routes have been blocked by the police.

391
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,440
If there's no way out by sea either,

392
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:57,680
maybe

393
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:59,080
they'll risk it all.

394
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:00,960
If they fight to the death,

395
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:01,920
the hostage will be in danger.

396
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,080
We must guarantee the hostage's safety at all costs.

397
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:05,800
I have a suggestion.

398
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:08,640
We can take an outwardly loose, inwardly tight approach.

399
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:09,920
Let's hear it.

400
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,840
Besides having the helicopters

401
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:13,920
patrol the sea at irregular intervals

402
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,280
to keep them from taking risks,

403
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,600
other coercive measures

404
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,320
will not be used for now.

405
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,040
And the inwardly tight part?

406
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:20,560
The inwardly tight part

407
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:24,240
depends on how Yang Maolin and his team perform.

408
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,680
But this is all just our guess.

409
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,960
Whether they will land on the island

410
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:29,880
is still uncertain.

411
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,520
They caught up so fast.

412
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,520
Boss Qiang,

413
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:38,200
maybe we should just rush out.

414
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:40,240
No.

415
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,480
We're totally exposed on the open sea.

416
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:44,680
If they spot us,

417
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,920
we'll be sitting ducks.

418
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:47,760
Are there any islands nearby?

419
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:49,520
On this route,

420
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,600
there's only a deserted island up ahead.

421
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,680
The terrain there is steep,

422
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,680
but it's heavily wooded.

423
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:56,800
It's good for hiding.

424
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,240
Have you been up there?

425
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,520
I just went up to scout the terrain.

426
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,520
Let's land on the deserted island.

427
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:21,960
Mountain Eagle, Mountain Eagle.

428
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:22,880
This is Honey Badger.

429
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:25,280
This is Mountain Eagle, go ahead.

430
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,840
The prey has gone up the mountain.

431
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:28,840
What's the current situation?

432
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:30,720
Current recon shows

433
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:33,120
the enemy has three professional armed men,

434
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,680
all carrying foreign standard assault rifles.

435
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:37,760
One of them is carrying a sniper rifle.

436
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,040
The other three hostiles

437
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,160
all have handguns.

438
00:21:40,760 --> 00:21:41,320
There are also

439
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:42,960
four hostages.

440
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:44,360
Four hostages?

441
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:45,520
Why is there one more?

442
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,240
Honey Badger, be advised.

443
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,360
The enemy is well-equipped.

444
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:50,600
Do not act rashly.

445
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:52,040
Follow orders for all actions.

446
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:53,240
Copy that.

447
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,160
But you're on the ground,

448
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,560
so how you best use those five rounds

449
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:57,680
will depend on the situation.

450
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:58,640
Stay safe.

451
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,640
Honey Badger copies.

452
00:22:17,360 --> 00:22:18,120
Boss Qiang.

453
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:20,720
This damn chopper keeps circling over the sea.

454
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:22,160
Are we compromised?

455
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,480
Highly likely.

456
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:25,480
But...

457
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:27,640
we have these hostages.

458
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,280
They won't try anything stupid.

459
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:39,280
Situation is critical, enemy threat is complex.

460
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:40,920
Even though the battalion commander ordered us

461
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,080
not to act recklessly,

462
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:44,400
we still must have a contingency plan.

463
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,960
We have guns right now,

464
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,080
but no live ammo.

465
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,080
We do have bullets.

466
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,600
But only five rounds.

467
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:51,920
Three rifle rounds.

468
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,560
Two pistol rounds.

469
00:22:54,520 --> 00:22:55,400
My plan is...

470
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:56,960
The three rifle rounds...

471
00:22:57,280 --> 00:22:58,000
One for me.

472
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:01,480
One each for snipers Ding Shaolong and Liu Dong.

473
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,040
The pistol rounds...

474
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,760
I'll keep them on me for now.

475
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:05,680
For emergency use.

476
00:23:05,840 --> 00:23:06,440
Platoon Leader,

477
00:23:06,560 --> 00:23:07,760
why don't you give me the pistol?

478
00:23:07,840 --> 00:23:08,960
I'll get close and shoot.

479
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:10,160
This isn't a drill.

480
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,720
We can't afford a single mistake.

481
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:15,640
The enemy's three bodyguards...

482
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:17,120
I observed them carefully just now.

483
00:23:17,760 --> 00:23:19,760
Judging by their movements,

484
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:21,280
they look like ex-military.

485
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:23,200
We can't be careless.

486
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:26,160
Our three rifle rounds

487
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,680
are reserved for them.

488
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:29,320
But

489
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,600
it's too dark now.

490
00:23:31,760 --> 00:23:33,120
We need an external light source.

491
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:34,800
Are we going to wait until dawn?

492
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:37,000
I still have a flare.

493
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:39,120
Lin Yihu, I'll leave it to you.

494
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,520
Wait for my order to fire.

495
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:42,280
Understood.

496
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,160
The moment the flare goes off,

497
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:46,600
we will follow the

498
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:48,280
left, center, right

499
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:49,040
target assignments.

500
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:49,760
Take them down individually.

501
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:51,200
I take left.

502
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:52,560
Liu Dong, center.

503
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:53,800
Shaolong, right.

504
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,360
Yes, sir.

505
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,280
Once we take out the bodyguards,

506
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:57,760
it might panic the other thugs

507
00:23:58,320 --> 00:23:59,240
and put the hostages in danger.

508
00:23:59,840 --> 00:24:00,440
So,

509
00:24:01,320 --> 00:24:02,280
the timing of our strike

510
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,400
must be precise.

511
00:24:03,840 --> 00:24:04,640
Is that clear?

512
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,440
Clear!

513
00:24:11,760 --> 00:24:12,760
Orders are to keep waiting.

514
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:16,040
The Wind Rider Battalion is at the front line.

515
00:24:16,280 --> 00:24:17,120
They must join the battle.

516
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,200
Then we...

517
00:24:19,040 --> 00:24:20,280
The purpose of the People's Army

518
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:22,200
is to serve the people wholeheartedly.

519
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:24,320
Now that people's lives are threatened,

520
00:24:24,320 --> 00:24:25,400
how can we stand by and watch?

521
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,160
Notify Guo Zijian.

522
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:28,600
Command from the front.

523
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,200
Engage per real combat requirements,

524
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:32,200
and use all available equipment with full authority.

525
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:33,520
What about the army commander and commissar?

526
00:24:33,520 --> 00:24:34,280
I'll talk to them.

527
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:35,560
None of the commanders

528
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:37,360
would be foolish at a time like this.

529
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,120
Carry it out immediately.

530
00:24:39,360 --> 00:24:39,920
Yes, sir.

531
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,440
Guo Zijian.

532
00:25:11,040 --> 00:25:12,000
I'm going with you.

533
00:25:12,360 --> 00:25:13,120
Guo Zijian.

534
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,240
Stay safe.

535
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:31,240
Location received. I'm moving out.

536
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:33,640
The helicopter has intentionally slowed down.

537
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:36,040
The hostiles will definitely use this chance to break out.

538
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,560
Watch your timing for the strike.

539
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:38,720
Understood.

540
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:40,400
Platoon Leader.

541
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,200
The targets are moving.

542
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:46,400
It's almost dawn.

543
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:48,120
The lighting is now sufficient

544
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:49,320
for eliminating the targets.

545
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:56,000
Liu Dong.

546
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:00,760
Shaolong.

547
00:26:03,560 --> 00:26:04,200
Listen up.

548
00:26:04,840 --> 00:26:06,400
The moment the flare is fired,

549
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:07,360
wait for my command

550
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,600
and fire simultaneously.

551
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:09,160
Yes, sir.

552
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:10,720
On your designated targets,

553
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,760
prepare to engage.

554
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:13,920
Execute.

555
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:23,200
Drop your weapons!

556
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:24,720
Surrender immediately!

557
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:27,120
Seek leniency!

558
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:32,320
Drop your weapons and surrender immediately!

559
00:26:39,480 --> 00:26:41,080
Good job, brother.

560
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,840
Don't worry.

561
00:26:43,080 --> 00:26:44,600
As long as I make it back alive,

562
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,760
you'll get paid handsomely.

563
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:48,000
Move!

564
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:49,040
Get up!

565
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:51,440
Move!

566
00:26:51,520 --> 00:26:52,080
Get up!

567
00:26:54,120 --> 00:26:54,720
Move!

568
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,520
Ding Shaolong, Liu Dong.

569
00:27:08,120 --> 00:27:09,200
Ding Shaolong in position.

570
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:10,800
Liu Dong in position.

571
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,240
When they board the ship,

572
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,520
that's the best time to shoot.

573
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:15,560
The flare will be your signal.

574
00:27:15,560 --> 00:27:16,440
Take the shot.

575
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:17,600
Lock onto your targets.

576
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,400
Stand by.

577
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:19,560
Ready.

578
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:20,680
Ready.

579
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,040
Lin Yihu, stand by.

580
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,120
Ready.

581
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:28,720
Fire.

582
00:27:38,320 --> 00:27:39,240
All targets neutralized.

583
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,280
